node-pty on illumos: illumos libc has no openpty/forkpty, so they are built
from posix_openpt + the ptem/ldterm/ttcompat STREAMS modules; libuv rejects a
pty master as a tty (EINVAL), so a socketpair relays it; the foreground
process comes from ioctl(TIOCGPGRP) and /proc/<pgrp>/psinfo.
Upstream: https://github.com/microsoft/node-pty (not sent yet)

